Modifications in this repository, relative to upstream Infinity 0.7.3:

  * A native arm64-apple-darwin port of the engine, server, unit tests and
    packaging. Linux and x86-64 build paths were removed rather than left
    unverified; the build refuses a non-Darwin host.
  * Optimizations to the HNSW index build for Apple's memory system:
    whole-vector prefetch, prefetch that skips visited candidates, a 128-byte
    prefetch stride, a four-accumulator L2 kernel and a batched
    one-query-against-four-candidates kernel, all dispatched at runtime.
  * Two storage correctness fixes: WAL commits made durable, and a range lock
    added to an unlocked rcu_multimap traversal.
  * Native macOS tooling under scripts/apple_silicon/ and tools/apple_silicon/,
    a benchmark harness under scripts/bench/, and documentation under
    docs/apple_silicon/.

